This Go port is derived from two programs, both released under this licence:

  TOIlet          The Other Implementation's letters
  Copyright (c) 2006 Sam Hocevar <sam@hocevar.net>

  libcaca         Colour ASCII-Art library
  Copyright (C) 2002-2021 Sam Hocevar <sam@hocevar.net>
                2006-2007 Jean-Yves Lamoureux <jylam@lnxscene.org>

TOIlet does its rendering and export work through libcaca, so the FIGfont
handling in figlet/ and the canvas operations in canvas/ are ports of
libcaca's figfont.c, canvas.c, string.c, attr.c, box.c, transform.c and
codec/text.c, while toilet/ and cmd/toilet/ port TOIlet's own sources.

The FIGfont files in fonts/ are separate works with their own licence. See
fonts/LICENSE.
